{{!
    @template local_coursepilot/location_selection_progress

    Progress band for location selection (Issue #551): one badge per target, filled
    by amd/src/location_selection.js instead of being assembled from strings.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * targets - array - list of {badgeclass, text} per pickable target

    Example context (json):
    {
        "targets": [
            {"badgeclass": "bg-secondary", "text": "Context area: open"},
            {"badgeclass": "bg-success", "text": "Material store: own folder"}
        ]
    }
}}
{{#targets}}<span class="badge {{badgeclass}}">{{text}}</span>{{/targets}}
